<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Health Care System</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f5; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div style="max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">

        <h2 style="color: #222;">
            Welcome to Health Care System, <%= name %> 👋
        </h2>

        <p style="color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
            Your account has been created successfully!
        </p>

        <p style="color: #777; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
            We're happy to have you with us. You can now log in and start using the Health Care System.
        </p>

        <div style="margin: 25px 0;">
            <p style="color: #555; font-size: 14px;">
                Thank you for joining us!
            </p>
        </div>

        <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px;">
            © Health Care System. All rights reserved.
        </p>

    </div>
</body>
</html>